WEBVTT

00:14:55.881 --> 00:15:00.779
ker je bil preveč depresiven.

00:15:00.779 --> 00:15:03.187
Ne morete si misliti, kako me to razburi.

00:15:03.187 --> 00:15:04.706
(Smeh)

00:15:04.706 --> 00:15:06.559
Gledate žensko,

00:15:06.559 --> 00:15:09.603
ki ima periodni sistem Muppetkov

00:15:09.603 --> 00:15:13.395
na steni svojega razdelka.

00:15:13.395 --> 00:15:17.154
Muppetek, ki žali druge, prav tamle.

00:15:18.239 --> 00:15:23.025
To je moj sin, na dan ko se je rodil.

00:15:23.025 --> 00:15:25.217
Bila sem čisto zadeta od morfija.

00:15:25.217 --> 00:15:29.080
Imela sem nepričakovan carski rez.

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:32.596
A tudi v megli od zdravil